      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُيَرَةٌ</span></b>  <i>That goes,</i> or <i>journeys, much:</i> or <i>a great
goer:</i> (IJ, M, K:) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَيُورٌ</span></b>  is applied as an
epithet [in the same sense] to a hackney, and to
an ass. (Az, TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فره</span>.)

